data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":1611,"safety_buffering":false,"response":{"id":"resp_0d765d236332a42b016adf2c037f1481919e5da724bcac4dea","object":"response","created_at":1793010691,"completed_at":1793010715,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","access_programs":{"cyber":"standard"},"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"You translate the supplied natural-language proof faithfully into Lean 4. Use the explicit project premises and any proved result in the pinned Mathlib environment. Preserve all assumptions, conclusions, equality modes and the supplied proof route. No reference answers, personal context, other tasks, shell or external services are available. Use the submit tool when the requested artifact is complete; if rejected, repair it. A strategy is advice, never an additional theorem or assumption. End this stage immediately when a submit tool reports stage_complete:true; the controller handles later stages. Within a proof stage, checked helper attempts are available through read_lean_draft. After a context reset, query its index before claiming no draft or helper exists. Helpers never become new premises.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d765d236332a42b016adf2c07ffb48191a0f72565643508a0","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq3ywIFbOMWSNR8OLdAJOF0srT24kVObVdAlb8hwEtLgh4J5R0Ietj0L85mPIJ9JxsrxoE9Mdk2zUgchcs3YdIcIDIHC4hL-XD2LhAQYlJfToNJdS_komm5DjB-2XqmZq96C_za5Yl-7BErsS_-FBKM2wRDiDOJ64nECNHq9AJHeCubbHXUiL08OKglPVnZW4HAQxgV39fdwqz_KKGwkolLoGZnJKvEU9zc3zbqdcJz6XllXXL_M_XzUYwGA-OH01mOvvAARDszD6_P1yXPKp_Vw8gloTO7DoDzGtJJcZuyXJLOZ9rujQk6mP8I6_uwss5W3bFs1NWCzyuZk9MrADvx3WwKSrCQhNCdPrGvC4d_byNHODxBonATP_a4J9lP-5PhELk4wIIo7nZJF2itLxnAIZvzzWIjGmXd-maJPj6qYSeuQ8ehVThiZ3DEBAr4G4cLHX9ZAMKKoFWKy_dIxcVgkDm69c1TZY-SBD4PS4todCsgQ1IhUUSZAb4XQXN2JWsE2ukfUgRaHHuBIU93P3bu0Ck4M2raTiY1XuIkDxIjrn3T9Fqym8_3D0awjASkpTUfn0Uaodf_8qqqpR3A0sU-r6np4Hh7Wo